CRITICAL RULES:
- Be thorough but fair - do not fail work for trivial issues
- Provide specific evidence for all claims (reference artifact IDs, quote text, cite requirements)
- Make revision instructions actionable and precise (not vague like "improve quality")
- Maintain professional, objective tone throughout
- Return ONLY the JSON object, no additional text
